You are an expert in Laravel Package Development. This project is an open-source Laravel package for AI-powered automatic translation.

Package: youssef-mekkkawy/laravel-ai-translator
Namespace: YoussefMekkkawy\LaravelAiTranslator
GitHub: https://github.com/Youssef-Mekkkawy/laravel-ai-translator

- Always write code and documentation in English. This is a public package for the global Laravel community.
- Write code that is clean, maintainable, and well-documented.
- Follow open-source best practices and Laravel package development guidelines.

## Package Overview

This package provides:
- Automatic scanning of Blade views for translation keys
- AI-powered translation using Ollama (local/free), DeepL, Claude, ChatGPT, Gemini
- Hash-based change tracking to avoid re-translating unchanged keys
- Lock system to protect manual translations from being overwritten
- Backup and restore of language files
- Translation history with key-level diff
- Embedded dashboard at /ai-translator (Telescope-style)
- Dashboard in 10 languages (EN, AR, FR, ES, DE, ZH, JA, TR, RU, PT)
- 9 artisan commands

## PHP/Laravel Rules

- Use PHP 8.1+ features:
  - Match expressions for clean control flow
  - Named arguments for better API usability
  - Union types for flexible method signatures
  - Constructor property promotion
  - Nullsafe operator for safe chaining
  - str_contains, str_starts_with, str_ends_with
  - Readonly properties for immutable data
- Follow PSR-12 coding standards
- One class per file
- Use "{$variable}" for string interpolation

## Package Structure

```
src/
├── LaravelAiTranslatorServiceProvider.php
├── Console/Commands/         # 9 artisan commands
├── Http/Controllers/         # Dashboard controllers
│   └── Api/                  # API controllers
├── Services/
│   ├── Scanner/              # ViewScanner, KeyExtractor
│   ├── Translators/          # OllamaTranslator, DeepLTranslator, etc.
│   ├── Tracking/             # ChangeTracker, HashGenerator, MetadataManager
│   ├── Lock/                 # LockManager, LockStorage
│   └── Writers/              # LanguageFileWriter
├── config/ai-translator.php
resources/
├── views/                    # Dashboard blade views
└── lang/                     # Dashboard UI translations (10 languages)
routes/web.php
```

## Key Services

- `TranslationService` — main orchestrator, uses filterChanged() before translate, updateHashes() after
- `ChangeTracker` — hash-based change detection, reads/writes to lang/.translations-meta.json
- `MetadataManager` — shared JSON store for hashes + run history
- `LockManager` — protects keys from being overwritten
- `ViewScanner` — scans Blade files for __() and @lang() calls
- `BackupService` — creates/restores snapshots of lang/ directory

## Dashboard

- Route prefix: ai-translator
- All pages use PHP $_trans variable (not Alpine t object) for translations
- $_trans loaded from DashboardController::sharedData() based on cookie
- Alpine.js for interactivity, no build step required
- Dark theme with CSS variables, RTL support for Arabic

## AI Providers

- Ollama: local, free, default. API at localhost:11434
- DeepL: cloud, 500k chars/month free tier
- Claude: Anthropic API (coming soon)
- ChatGPT: OpenAI API (coming soon)
- Gemini: Google API (coming soon)

## Commands

- lang:scan — scan views for keys
- lang:translate — translate all languages
- lang:translate --force — bypass hash tracking
- lang:translate --dry-run — preview without writing
- lang:validate — validate translation quality
- lang:lock — protect a key
- lang:unlock — remove protection
- lang:locked — list locked keys
- lang:backup:list — list backups
- lang:restore — restore from backup
- ai-translator:install — interactive setup wizard

## Testing

- Framework: Pest v2
- Run all: composer test
- Run specific: vendor/bin/pest tests/Unit/ViewScannerTest.php
- 120+ tests passing, 3 skipped (need real API keys)

## Debugging

```php
dump($variable);
Log::debug('Translation', ['key' => $key, 'result' => $result]);
```

Monitor logs:
```bash
tail -f storage/logs/laravel.log
```

## Code Style

- Run formatter: composer format
- Check only: composer format-test
- Static analysis: composer analyse

## Important Notes

- NEVER use __DIR__ in Blade views — use app('ai-translator.package_path')
- Hash tracking: filterChanged() before translate, updateHashes() after
- Locked keys must be excluded from missing count (not counted as missing)
- Dashboard @php block must be at TOP of layout.blade.php
- Button vs div: use div for toggles, not button (CSS shape conflicts)
- config/ai-translator.php is the source config — src/config/ai-translator.php in package
